Table 3 counts the verdicts by paper and by claim row.

> **Finding.** On claims taken from papers, {{c_paper_repro}} of {{c_paper}} reproduce and {{c_paper_fail}} fail. The remaining {{c_ours}} rows test our own baselines, for example that the commanded joints beat the world model, and {{c_ours_repro}} of those hold.


